{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310406001:0":{"text":"게르다 부인도 무도회에 참가하러 오셨군요!","source_cn":"格尔达女士，你也来参加舞会了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFB4CC3C15480AE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310406002:0":{"text":"물론이죠. 전 인파를 좋아해요! 매년 시더 마을에서는 요 며칠이 가장 북적거릴 때죠.","source_cn":"当然，我很喜欢人群！每年的雪松镇里，也就数这几天最热闹了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE66F88A1E1D2FD3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310406003:0":{"text":"온천 여관만 아니면 분명 신나게 한바탕 즐겼을 거예요!","source_cn":"要不是得看顾温泉旅馆，我肯定要玩个痛快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EF5A0CC1D620F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310406004:0":{"text":"저것 좀 보세요. 공주님께서 발랄하고 귀여운 모습으로 꾸미셨네요. 안색도 전보다 더 나아지셨고요!","source_cn":"你们瞧，有神明保佑，公主殿下打扮得又活泼又可爱，气色也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDCB88492E062CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310406005:0":{"text":"공주님은 겨울의 모닥불 같은 존재라, 그녀가 없었다면 제전은 쓸쓸했을 거예요.","source_cn":"她是冬夜里的篝火，没有她的祭典，会很萧瑟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4838A8A4AF2CD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","do